  {
    "insert": "Shortcomings in Current Literature ",
    "attributes": {
      "bold": true,
      "underline": true
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n\nThe exposé notes a gap in the current academic literature, indicating that while there has been extensive research on AI in diagnostics and drug development, its role in perioperative communication has not yet been explored. However, this point is only briefly addressed, and the connection between existing studies and the proposed research is not fully articulated. The SOTA section should delve deeper into past methodologies and results from other studies, clearly identifying their shortcomings and explaining how this research intends to overcome them. \n\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "Alignment of Research Questions with the Problem Statement ",
