  },
  {
    "insert": "\n\nThe research questions are aligned with the problem statement, focusing on applying generative AI to improve communication. Nevertheless, the questions lack precision. Phrases such as “reducing misunderstandings” and “significance” are vague and need to be defined with measurable criteria. This ambiguity could hinder the ability to assess the project's outcomes. To improve alignment, the questions should be reformulated to reflect clear, actionable objectives. \n\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "Elimination of Uncertainty in Terminology ",
