  },
  {
    "insert": "\n\nAlthough the research questions are relevant, they contain ambiguous terminology that needs clarification. For example, “minimizing misunderstandings” could be more explicitly phrased as “restricting misunderstandings.” Similarly, the term \"meaningful questions\" should be defined using specific parameters, such as their relevance to patient care or the clarity of their formulation. Clarifying these ambiguities would enhance the project's lucidity and evaluability. \n\n"
