    "insert": "\n\nThe chosen methodology, which consists of interviews and scenario-based testing, is considered appropriate for addressing the research questions. However, the explanation lacks specifics. For example, the exposé does not detail how the scenarios will be designed, how the interviews will be conducted, or how the data will be analyzed. Including approaches like thematic analysis for qualitative data or evaluation frameworks for AI-generated inquiries would improve the methodology. Furthermore, it is unclear how the effectiveness of the open-source AI models will be assessed, including the criteria for evaluating the quality of the questions generated.\n"
